    "name": "Outlaw Kingdom",
    "steam_appid": 2367460,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outlaw Kingdom is an accessible yet profound content-rich Strategic Auto Battler with Roguelite elements. Lead your own outlaw crew to rob, steal, and fight for riches. Build up your camp and recruit more outlaws so you can take over the Kingdom.  <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367460/extras/d9ea415f2d5c4a9937b3be410baa26bc.avif?t=1735488839\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367460/extras/7366bb3adb6790372fa1f3a8d0c19ed0.poster.avif?t=1735488839\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367460/extras/7366bb3adb6790372fa1f3a8d0c19ed0.webm?t=1735488839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategy is crucial in ambushing unsuspecting travelers. Outlaw Kingdom allows you to plan your strategic ambushes in your style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367460/extras/fa9d29ee629d7be623ea4e39c29ab769.avif?t=1735488839\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367460/extras/874575e36d5e908f259e58537d7ad94c.poster.avif?t=1735488839\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367460/extras/874575e36d5e908f259e58537d7ad94c.webm?t=1735488839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies have their own strategies for ensuring safe travel. Watch the enemy patrols carefully to find the best opportunity for attack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367460/extras/181076a746b3d73ffcae964e1d87d73d.avif?t=1735488839\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367460/extras/c173f5d7e695227f4052b766533eb45a.poster.avif?t=1735488839\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367460/extras/c173f5d7e695227f4052b766533eb45a.webm?t=1735488839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you feel the time is right, signal groups of units to attack, sending them all in one go or sending out groups in waves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367460/extras/2c9b450fc4a0459c01d013b05810843a.avif?t=1735488839\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367460/extras/e5cee7749721655a306a96040c70a452.poster.avif?t=1735488839\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367460/extras/e5cee7749721655a306a96040c70a452.webm?t=1735488839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Villages are a source of bountiful resources, just waiting to be raided and pillaged. However, be careful not to burn everything down, as no one wants to re-supply a completely non-existent village with more resources. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367460/extras/d1486290e4654d8b933da1539e10adc1.avif?t=1735488839\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367460/extras/7ff3d9e624c9a023046038e8a950bc63.poster.avif?t=1735488839\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367460/extras/7ff3d9e624c9a023046038e8a950bc63.webm?t=1735488839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even outlaws need a place to call home, so build up your outlaw camp with new buildings, recruit additional outlaws, and train existing outlaws to upgrade them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367460/extras/e7329ed553218fd1d23f7be851483ef5.avif?t=1735488839\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367460/extras/9741cbd693d58a23e2844b33c09c401b.poster.avif?t=1735488839\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367460/extras/9741cbd693d58a23e2844b33c09c401b.webm?t=1735488839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the overworld to find the ideal place to ambush your targets or find the perfect target to raid for resources. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367460/extras/34aae1f17253e2b115b5577f64f1ca34.avif?t=1735488839\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose between 4 commanders that comes with unique playstyle, events, units and buildings.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outlaw Kingdom is an accessible yet profound content-rich Strategic Auto Battler with Roguelite elements. Lead your own outlaw crew to rob, steal, and fight for riches. Build up your camp and recruit more outlaws so you can take over the Kingdom.  <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367460/extras/d9ea415f2d5c4a9937b3be410baa26bc.avif?t=1735488839\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367460/extras/7366bb3adb6790372fa1f3a8d0c19ed0.poster.avif?t=1735488839\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367460/extras/7366bb3adb6790372fa1f3a8d0c19ed0.webm?t=1735488839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategy is crucial in ambushing unsuspecting travelers. Outlaw Kingdom allows you to plan your strategic ambushes in your style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367460/extras/fa9d29ee629d7be623ea4e39c29ab769.avif?t=1735488839\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367460/extras/874575e36d5e908f259e58537d7ad94c.poster.avif?t=1735488839\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367460/extras/874575e36d5e908f259e58537d7ad94c.webm?t=1735488839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies have their own strategies for ensuring safe travel. Watch the enemy patrols carefully to find the best opportunity for attack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367460/extras/181076a746b3d73ffcae964e1d87d73d.avif?t=1735488839\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367460/extras/c173f5d7e695227f4052b766533eb45a.poster.avif?t=1735488839\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367460/extras/c173f5d7e695227f4052b766533eb45a.webm?t=1735488839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you feel the time is right, signal groups of units to attack, sending them all in one go or sending out groups in waves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367460/extras/2c9b450fc4a0459c01d013b05810843a.avif?t=1735488839\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367460/extras/e5cee7749721655a306a96040c70a452.poster.avif?t=1735488839\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367460/extras/e5cee7749721655a306a96040c70a452.webm?t=1735488839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Villages are a source of bountiful resources, just waiting to be raided and pillaged. However, be careful not to burn everything down, as no one wants to re-supply a completely non-existent village with more resources. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367460/extras/d1486290e4654d8b933da1539e10adc1.avif?t=1735488839\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367460/extras/7ff3d9e624c9a023046038e8a950bc63.poster.avif?t=1735488839\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367460/extras/7ff3d9e624c9a023046038e8a950bc63.webm?t=1735488839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even outlaws need a place to call home, so build up your outlaw camp with new buildings, recruit additional outlaws, and train existing outlaws to upgrade them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367460/extras/e7329ed553218fd1d23f7be851483ef5.avif?t=1735488839\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367460/extras/9741cbd693d58a23e2844b33c09c401b.poster.avif?t=1735488839\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367460/extras/9741cbd693d58a23e2844b33c09c401b.webm?t=1735488839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the overworld to find the ideal place to ambush your targets or find the perfect target to raid for resources. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367460/extras/34aae1f17253e2b115b5577f64f1ca34.avif?t=1735488839\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose between 4 commanders that comes with unique playstyle, events, units and buildings.</p>",
